{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14220030","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14220030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1422003001:0":{"text":"吉姆，德鲁斯，你俩怎么都不回营地躲在这？营地又出事啦？","source_cn":"吉姆，德鲁斯，你俩怎么都不回营地躲在这？营地又出事啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB55799DF035F15F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422003002:1":{"text":"又出事？营地之前出什么事啦？","source_cn":"又出事？营地之前出什么事啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DCD8DD811B22893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422003003:0":{"text":"机械守卫不听话那次！还是我这位朋友帮忙摆平的。","source_cn":"机械守卫不听话那次！还是我这位朋友帮忙摆平的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x39BF7466987CABE3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"机械守卫不听话那次！还是我这位朋友帮忙摆平的。","female":"机械守卫不听话那次！还是我这位朋友帮忙摆平的。","variant_male_record_index":"164659","variant_female_record_index":"164660","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422003004:0":{"text":"哦哦，你就是他们说的那个耀光魔法师！不愧是祖娅找来的人，这才是大师啊。","source_cn":"哦哦，你就是他们说的那个耀光魔法师！不愧是祖娅找来的人...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x676EF3BC794780AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"哦哦，你就是他们说的那个耀光魔法师！不愧是祖娅找来的人，这才是大师啊。","female":"哦哦，你就是他们说的那个耀光魔法师！不愧是祖娅找来的人，这才是大师啊。","variant_male_record_index":"164661","variant_female_record_index":"164662","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422003005:0":{"text":"我们在躲拉瓦斯呢，有他在营地一天，我是一步都不敢踏进去了！","source_cn":"我们在躲拉瓦斯呢，有他在营地一天，我是一步都不敢踏进去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD867B550BADEFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422003006:0":{"text":"拉瓦斯天天在营地里鼓捣什么酿造器，还逼着我们喝他酿出来的东西！我是一点都喝不下了……","source_cn":"拉瓦斯天天在营地里鼓捣什么酿造器，还逼着我们喝他酿出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D77729F8A66771F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422003007:0":{"text":"我还以为什么事呢，矮人还怕这个？拉瓦斯免费给你们提供饮品……这是好事啊！","source_cn":"我还以为什么事呢，矮人还怕这个？拉瓦斯免费给你们提供饮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3472A4BD5F6BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422003008:1":{"text":"你说的倒是轻松……","source_cn":"你说的倒是轻松……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F6B0DDAD208139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422003009:0":{"text":"如果那真能被称为“饮品”就好了……","source_cn":"如果那真能被称为“饮品”就好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8A38A5FD7FF7E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422003010:0":{"text":"祖娅，魔法师，你们帮我们劝劝拉瓦斯吧，我俩的话他一点都听不进去！","source_cn":"祖娅，魔法师，你们帮我们劝劝拉瓦斯吧，我俩的话他一点都...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x911107E82DE6676E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_targe